# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Evidence library for Aster (gender-affirming care for trans and gender diverse adults).
Each entry: pmid (or url + citation for non-PubMed sources), s = short label, k = kind of study,
g = grade of the main finding (strong / mod / weak / no, or "" for guidelines and services),
t = topic, pop = who was studied, f = what was found, in plain English.
Citations and DOIs for PubMed entries are filled in by cite.py from records checked against PubMed
(records.json, retrieved 21 November 2026)."""

